Pretrained encoder weights

PixelDiT2 loads frozen vision encoders at runtime through `timm`; their weights
are not redistributed here and are governed by their own licenses.

  DINOv3 (grounding encoder) — Meta Platforms, DINOv3 License
    timm/vit_small_patch16_dinov3_qkvb.lvd1689m
    timm/vit_base_patch16_dinov3_qkvb.lvd1689m
    timm/vit_large_patch16_dinov3_qkvb.lvd1689m

  DINOv2 (REPA target, training only) — Meta Platforms, Apache License 2.0
    timm/vit_base_patch14_dinov2.lvd142m

The released PixelDiT2 checkpoints do not contain encoder weights. The frozen
encoder weights are loaded from timm at runtime.

