FID reference statistics

The ImageNet-256 and ImageNet-512 reference statistics used to reproduce the
reported FID values are the files tracked in the JiT repository
(https://github.com/LTH14/JiT, fid_stats/jit_in256_stats.npz and
fid_stats/jit_in512_stats.npz). They are not redistributed here.
